{"1804470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duel Corp.", "steam_appid": 1804470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.poster.avif?t=1769011185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.webm?t=1769011185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.mp4?t=1769011185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Souls-inspired action RPG set in a sandbox open world with an MMO feel and challenging directional combat. Play solo or with up to 3 friends in co-op. Build friendships, master an unrestricted class system, and uncover the cause that darkened all eyes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is not told in a linear fashion. Instead, you experience it naturally as you explore the world, interact with factions, and discover their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main plot revolves around an event that darkened everyone's eyes. This event had two far-reaching consequences: it gave all living beings a cursed immortality and resurrected the dead as soulless beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result, the world fragmented into factions, each with its own ideology on how to deal with this new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek to restore the natural order at any cost. Others believe this state of affairs is a form of evolution or a blessing, but now struggle to control the relentless threat posed by the soulless. Still others seek a way to coexist with or even control the soulless, viewing them as a resource rather than an abomination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization: </strong>Use a character editor to customize your avatar's appearance to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrestricted Class Sytem:</strong> Craft a deep, fully customizable class using a wide variety of weapons, armor, abilities, and talents tailored to your playstyle. A stealthy rogue wielding a great axe and hurling fireballs, anything is possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direction-based Combat:</strong> Engage in intense, challenging, and fluid directional combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story: </strong>The story is not told in a linear fashion. Instead, you experience it naturally as you explore the world, interact with factions, and discover their secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMO Feel:</strong> Discover a lively world with MMO feel, where you can meet and interact with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer:</strong> Play solo with up to three companions or in co-op mode with up to four players. Build friendships with your companions, customize their equipment and skills, and tailor their playstyle to suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer: </strong>Easily participate in co-op quests for up to four players or competitive PvP battles (1v1 and 2v2). The matchmaking feature lets you jump right into the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Open-World Sandbox:</strong> Shape the world through your actions by intercepting caravans to weaken villages, exploiting conflicts between rival factions, and conquering villages and cities to take control and collect taxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Encounters:</strong> Discover varied, procedurally generated encounters full of secrets, unique items, allies, and challenges. Find your own way to overcome obstacles by creatively using the skills you've acquired.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro meets modern gaming:</strong> Step into a unique pixel-art retro fantasy environment with 2D HD textures in modern and never-before-seen graphics full of surprises, twisted monsters and deadly bosses.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.poster.avif?t=1769011185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.webm?t=1769011185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/extras/e3ab2f2f97b61d78554a3ce625ee9390.mp4?t=1769011185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Souls-inspired action RPG set in a sandbox open world with an MMO feel and challenging directional combat. Play solo or with up to 3 friends in co-op. Build friendships, master an unrestricted class system, and uncover the cause that darkened all eyes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is not told in a linear fashion. Instead, you experience it naturally as you explore the world, interact with factions, and discover their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main plot revolves around an event that darkened everyone's eyes. This event had two far-reaching consequences: it gave all living beings a cursed immortality and resurrected the dead as soulless beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result, the world fragmented into factions, each with its own ideology on how to deal with this new reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some seek to restore the natural order at any cost. Others believe this state of affairs is a form of evolution or a blessing, but now struggle to control the relentless threat posed by the soulless. Still others seek a way to coexist with or even control the soulless, viewing them as a resource rather than an abomination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization: </strong>Use a character editor to customize your avatar's appearance to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrestricted Class Sytem:</strong> Craft a deep, fully customizable class using a wide variety of weapons, armor, abilities, and talents tailored to your playstyle. A stealthy rogue wielding a great axe and hurling fireballs, anything is possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direction-based Combat:</strong> Engage in intense, challenging, and fluid directional combat scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story: </strong>The story is not told in a linear fashion. Instead, you experience it naturally as you explore the world, interact with factions, and discover their secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMO Feel:</strong> Discover a lively world with MMO feel, where you can meet and interact with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer:</strong> Play solo with up to three companions or in co-op mode with up to four players. Build friendships with your companions, customize their equipment and skills, and tailor their playstyle to suit your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer: </strong>Easily participate in co-op quests for up to four players or competitive PvP battles (1v1 and 2v2). The matchmaking feature lets you jump right into the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Open-World Sandbox:</strong> Shape the world through your actions by intercepting caravans to weaken villages, exploiting conflicts between rival factions, and conquering villages and cities to take control and collect taxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Encounters:</strong> Discover varied, procedurally generated encounters full of secrets, unique items, allies, and challenges. Find your own way to overcome obstacles by creatively using the skills you've acquired.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro meets modern gaming:</strong> Step into a unique pixel-art retro fantasy environment with 2D HD textures in modern and never-before-seen graphics full of surprises, twisted monsters and deadly bosses.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Souls-inspired action RPG set in a sandbox open world with an MMO feel and challenging directional combat. Play solo or with up to 3 friends in co-op. Build friendships, master an unrestricted class system, and uncover the cause that darkened all eyes.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian, Turkish, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/13e8617cad7d3392d29e614ff07435f8d72fd837/header.jpg?t=1769011185", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/04bfa604fdbfa13f4ed08df282f70442ed30fb70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769011185", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1804470/04bfa604fdbfa13f4ed08df282f70442ed30fb70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769011185", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</str